               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "KAIZO Research Facility: An enigmatic institution birthed by the KAIZO Corporation. Once groundbreaking humanity-enhancment experiments were conducted here using a highly potent viral serum - the progenitor to the zombie pandemic. Despite this damning history being cloaked from public knowledge, conspiracies swirl around its heavily armed government and military protectors.\n\nVestiges of illicit and morally reprehensible experiments permeate throughout. This hazardous serum proved instrumental in creating superhuman entities: bestowing unyielding stamina allowing for near-constant activity even up to three full days of unbroken carnal endeavors. Its use however came with a perilous risk – lacking requisite antibodies rendered subjects into relentless zombies whereas those possessing antibodies achieved extraordinary vitality.",
